{"id": "1bbaa5cc-5086-40fb-817b-6ec92fee203a", "slug": "identity-verification", "title": "Identity Verification", "description": "Identity Verification Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Identity Verification\"\ndescription: \"Identity Verification Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#22D3EE\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#22D3EE\"\n  background: \"#0A0D14\"\n  surface: \"#11141D\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#232838\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"ui-monospace\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"ui-monospace\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"14px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Identity Verification\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 61; favorites: 3; remixes: 1.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nIdentity Verification Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nKey Features Fast enough for users. Secure enough for business. Our app uses the same FaceID technology trusted by millions of Apple users worldwide to keep your information safe. Biometric Precision Highly accurate fac…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Fast enough for users. Secure enough for business.; Biometric Precision; Encrypted Infrastructure; No documents, no problem; Global Verification; Instant Verification.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #22D3EE, secondary #000000, accent #22D3EE, background #0A0D14, surface #11141D, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and ui-monospace for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use ui-monospace or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Identity Verification</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0A0D14] text-white min-h-screen selection:bg-cyan-500/30 font-sans\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #151A28 0%, #0A0D14 60%);\">\n\n    <!-- Header Section -->\n    <div class=\"pt-24 pb-16 px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center relative z-10\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-cyan-400 text-sm font-medium mb-6 bg-cyan-400/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-cyan-400/20 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,211,238,0.1)]\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"font-geist\">Key Features</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-6 leading-[1.1] text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-gray-300 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">\n            Fast enough for users.<br>Secure enough for business.\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"text-[#8890A4] text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed font-geist\">\n            Our app uses the same FaceID technology trusted by millions of Apple users worldwide to keep your information safe.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bento Grid Container -->\n    <div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 pb-32 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Column 1 -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\">\n\n            <!-- Card: Biometric Precision -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-white/[0.04] relative overflow-hidden group min-h-[420px] flex flex-col transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/[0.08] hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.02] to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg mb-3 text-gray-100 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Biometric Precision</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-[#8890A4] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-12 font-geist\">Highly accurate facial recognition ensures only the right user gains access.</p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-center justify-center relative mt-4\">\n                    <!-- Decorative background lines -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-[150%] h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[1px] h-[150%] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/5 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Outer embossed box -->\n                    <div class=\"w-48 h-48 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-[#141824] shadow-[inset_0_0_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),_0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] border border-[#232838] flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\">\n                        <!-- Side node connectors -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-[-12px] w-3 h-1 bg-[#232838]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-[-12px] w-3 h-1 bg-[#232838]\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Inner glowing box -->\n                        <div class=\"w-[104px] h-[104px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1C2132] to-[#11141D] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.08),_0_10px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] border border-[#2D3348] flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                             <!-- Glowing background aura -->\n                             <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-400/20 blur-xl rounded-full animate-pulse\"></div>\n                             <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-bold\" class=\"text-6xl text-cyan-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,211,238,0.8)] relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card: Encrypted Infrastructure -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] rounded-[2rem] p-8 pb-0 border border-white/[0.04] relative overflow-hidden group min-h-[380px] flex flex-col justify-start transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/[0.08]\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg mb-3 text-gray-100 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Encrypted Infrastructure</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-[#8890A4] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 relative z-10 font-geist\">All biometric data is encrypted and protected using enterprise-grade security standards.</p>\n\n                <div class=\"relative w-full flex-grow flex justify-center items-end opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\">\n                    <!-- Bottom Dial Assembly -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-120px] w-[340px] h-[340px] rounded-full bg-[#141824] shadow-[inset_0_10px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9),_0_-10px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] border-t border-[#232838] flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n                        <!-- Cyan tick marks using repeating gradient -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-6 rounded-full\" style=\"background: repeating-conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0deg 2.5deg, rgba(34,211,238,0.6) 2.5deg 3deg, transparent 3deg 5.5deg); mask-image: radial-gradient(transparent 92%, black 93%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(transparent 92%, black 93%);\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Grey tick marks -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-2 rounded-full\" style=\"background: repeating-conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0deg 4deg, #2D3348 4deg 4.5deg, transparent 4.5deg 8deg); mask-image: radial-gradient(transparent 95%, black 96%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(transparent 95%, black 96%); opacity: 0.5;\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Inner raised dial -->\n                        <div class=\"w-[240px] h-[240px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1C2132] to-[#11141D] shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),_0_15px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] border border-[#232838] flex items-center justify-center relative\">\n                             <!-- Center shield emblem -->\n                             <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-[#141824] border border-[#2D3348] shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                 <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-bold\" class=\"text-2xl text-gray-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                             </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Column 2 -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\">\n\n            <!-- Card: No documents (Tall) -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-white/[0.04] relative overflow-hidden group flex flex-col h-[600px] transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/[0.08]\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg mb-3 text-gray-100 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">No documents, no problem</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-[#8890A4] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-10 font-geist\">the future of identity verification, where you're in control and it all happens in the blink of an eye.</p>\n\n                <div class=\"relative flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full pb-8\">\n\n                    <!-- Background connection line (Vertical) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[10%] bottom-[15%] w-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Top Node -->\n                    <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1A1F2D] to-[#11141D] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),_0_10px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] border border-[#232838] flex items-center justify-center z-10 mb-12 transform transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                         <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-gray-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Middle Complex Node -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full max-w-[260px] rounded-[1.5rem] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1A1F2D] to-[#141824] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),_0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] border border-[#232838] p-5 flex items-center gap-5 z-10 relative group-hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(34,211,238,0.05)] transition-all duration-500\">\n                         <!-- Horizontal passing line -->\n                         <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-[-2rem] right-[-2rem] h-[1px] bg-white/5 -z-10\"></div>\n                         <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-[-1.5rem] w-[5px] h-[5px] rounded-full bg-gray-500 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n                         <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 right-[-1.5rem] w-[5px] h-[5px] rounded-full bg-gray-500 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n\n                         <!-- Inside Middle Node: Avatar -->\n                         <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-[14px] bg-[#0E1119] shadow-[inset_0_2px_5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center relative\">\n                             <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-400/10 blur-md rounded-full\"></div>\n                             <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-bold\" class=\"text-2xl text-cyan-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(34,211,238,0.5)] relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                         </div>\n\n                         <!-- Inside Middle Node: Skeletons -->\n                         <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5 flex-grow\">\n                             <div class=\"h-1.5 w-1/2 bg-[#3A4155] rounded-full\"></div>\n                             <div class=\"h-1.5 w-[85%] bg-[#232838] rounded-full\"></div>\n                             <div class=\"h-1.5 w-[65%] bg-[#232838] rounded-full\"></div>\n                         </div>\n\n                         <!-- UI Dots -->\n                         <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-4 flex gap-1.5\">\n                             <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3A4155]\"></div>\n                             <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3A4155]\"></div>\n                             <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3A4155]\"></div>\n                         </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bottom Node -->\n                    <div class=\"w-20 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1A1F2D] to-[#11141D] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),_0_10px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] border border-[#232838] flex items-center justify-center mt-12 z-10\">\n                         <div class=\"w-6 h-[3px] bg-[#3A4155] rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card: Global Verification (Small) -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-white/[0.04] relative overflow-hidden group flex-grow flex flex-col justify-end min-h-[180px] transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/[0.08]\">\n                 <!-- Subtle ground glow -->\n                 <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[80%] h-32 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-cyan-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700\"></div>\n\n                 <!-- Background faint grid/map texture (simulated with radial gradient) -->\n                 <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_rgba(255,255,255,0.02)_1px,_transparent_1px)] bg-[size:16px_16px] opacity-20\"></div>\n\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg mb-2 relative z-10 text-gray-100 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Global Verification</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-[#8890A4] text-sm leading-relaxed relative z-10 m-0 font-geist\">Verify identity across devices and locations with consistent accuracy and security.</p>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Column 3 -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\">\n\n            <!-- Card: Instant Verification -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-white/[0.04] relative overflow-hidden group min-h-[420px] flex flex-col transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/[0.08] hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.02] to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg mb-3 text-gray-100 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Instant Verification</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-[#8890A4] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-12 font-geist\">Confirm identity in seconds with real-time biometric authentication. no delays.</p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-center justify-center relative mt-4\">\n                     <!-- Horizontal passing line with glowing dots -->\n                     <div class=\"absolute w-[140%] h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n                     <div class=\"absolute left-[5%] w-[5px] h-[5px] rounded-full bg-gray-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\"></div>\n                     <div class=\"absolute right-[5%] w-[5px] h-[5px] rounded-full bg-gray-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\"></div>\n\n                     <!-- Outer segmented ring -->\n                     <div class=\"w-[200px] h-[200px] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 bg-[#161A26]\" style=\"background: repeating-conic-gradient(from 0deg, #1C2132 0deg 15deg, #11141D 15deg 18deg); mask-image: radial-gradient(transparent 68%, black 69%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(transparent 68%, black 69%);\"></div>\n\n                     <!-- Dark background behind inner timer -->\n                     <div class=\"absolute w-[180px] h-[180px] rounded-full bg-[#11141D] shadow-[inset_0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] flex items-center justify-center z-10 border border-[#1A1F2D]\">\n\n                         <!-- Inner raised timer plate -->\n                         <div class=\"w-[120px] h-[120px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1C2132] to-[#11141D] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.08),_0_10px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-[#2D3348] relative overflow-hidden group-hover:border-cyan-900/50 transition-colors duration-500\">\n\n                             <!-- Subtle inner cyan glow -->\n                             <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_rgba(34,211,238,0.1)_0%,_transparent_70%)]\"></div>\n\n                             <span class=\"text-[26px] font-medium tracking-tight text-cyan-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(34,211,238,0.6)] relative z-10 font-geist\" style=\"font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\">00:10</span>\n                             <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#5C657A] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] mt-1 font-medium relative z-10 font-geist\">Max Speed</span>\n                         </div>\n                     </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card: Peace of Mind -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-white/[0.04] relative overflow-hidden group min-h-[380px] flex flex-col transition-all duration-500 hover:border-white/[0.08]\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg mb-3 text-gray-100 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Peace of Mind</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-[#8890A4] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-12 font-geist\">Know where your data is and who's accessing it. Complete control over your digital identity.</p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-center justify-center relative\">\n                     <!-- Deep background glow -->\n                     <div class=\"absolute w-40 h-40 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full blur-[100px] opacity-[0.07] group-hover:opacity-[0.12] transition-opacity duration-700\"></div>\n\n                     <!-- UI Data Pill -->\n                     <div class=\"bg-[#1A1F2D]/60 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[1.25rem] p-4 pr-10 border border-white/10 flex flex-col gap-2 relative z-10 shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5),_inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] transform transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:-translate-y-2\">\n                         <div class=\"flex items-end gap-8\">\n                             <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                 <span class=\"text-[9px] text-[#5C657A] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.15em] mb-1.5 font-geist\">Name</span>\n                                 <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-100 font-geist\">Jhon</span>\n                             </div>\n                             <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                 <span class=\"text-[9px] text-[#5C657A] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.15em] mb-1.5 font-geist\">Location</span>\n                                 <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#8890A4] font-geist\">Sydney, AU</span>\n                             </div>\n                         </div>\n                     </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "identity-verification.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/identity-verification.jpg", "source_name": "identity-verification-DESIGN.md", "views": 105, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:29:20.500556+00:00"}